  "description": "Single-file scripting SDK for .NET 10+ AI agents. Vendor-neutral wrapper over Microsoft.Extensions.AI that exposes an OpenAI-compatible Chat Completion HTTP endpoint, so tools like Codex / Aider / Continue / Cursor can talk to your agent as if it were OpenAI. Plug in Ollama, OpenAI, Anthropic, Azure OpenAI, or any IChatClient. Use with `#:sdk Cadenza.Agent@1.0.13` in file-based apps (replace with latest version — MSBuild SDK refs require exact versions).",
